flowchart LR
    A[User types message text] --> B[User provides time_of_day]
    B --> C[normalize_time_of_day]
    C --> D[Create one-row DataFrame]

    D --> E[Pipeline feature extraction]
    E --> F[Text count features]
    E --> G[Time-of-day token feature]

    F --> H[MultinomialNB]
    G --> H

    H --> I[Predicted label]
    H --> J[Class probabilities]
    I --> K[Display predicted sender]
    J --> L[Display ranked top probabilities]